 r←Test_Init_97(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log;qdmx
⍝ Exercise `Run` with error trapping and an `Initial_Foo` that returns a 2: that is invalid and signals error 11
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_Foo_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Initial_Foo' 'r←2'
 :Trap 11
     (rc log)←T2.Run 0
     →T.FailsIf 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.PassesIf'Function "#.Temp.Initial_Foo" returned an invalid result: neither a Boolean nor a text vector'≡qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 r←T._OK
